cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data releases, please cite them as below."
title: "Leveraged Loan Factors"
abstract: >-
  Open-source pipeline and data releases of factor returns for US leveraged loans, built from public SEC Form
  N-PORT filings of US registered investment funds, and of the Open Direct Lending Indices (OpenDL Europe,
  OpenDL US BDC and OpenDL US), built from the schedules of investments of business development companies and
  the Form N-PORT holdings of registered closed-end funds.
